          "text": "🏳️‍🌈Pride is more than a celebration; it is a call to action.💪\n\nToday, we celebrate the International Day of LGBTQI+ Pride. As Socialists and Democrats, we will always stand for equality, freedom, dignity and justice for all.\n\nAnd this fight is of utmost importance right now: across Europe and beyond, LGBTQI+ rights are under attack. That is why we must remain united, proud, and determined.\n\nToday, we celebrate every person who dares to live openly and every activist who has fought for their rights and continues to fight.\n\nToday, we celebrate LGBTQI+ rights and progress, but we keep fighting until equality becomes reality for everyone.🌈"
